  "title": "bssgp: use the right table for Attach Indicator string lookup",
  "description": "In BSSGP protocol dissector, the Attach Indicator IE cannot be properly dissected and displayed as the appropriate human readable string is looked up in a table which doesn't provide it.\n\nReproduction PCAP: [attach_indicator.pcap](/uploads/18143a7f54cd6680e62ef25e8214375f/attach_indicator.pcap) NOTE: The attached PCAP is semantically incorrect in other respects, but that's on us, the only Wireshark issue is with the one IE dissection.\n\nBefore this PR:\n\n![before](/uploads/b3db86b39ccb5e04fda3e8c5f9a0c74a/before.png)\n\nAfter this PR:\n\n![after](/uploads/d8c1fdd780403a7643a7b30d5cdc4cb9/after.png)",
